Vaibhav Kishore : tell me the features of iphone 15
Kishore : **iPhone 15 Series (released September 2025)**  
| Feature | iPhone 15 / 15 Plus | iPhone 15 Pro / 15 Pro Max |
|---------|---------------------|----------------------------|
| **Design** | 6.1‑inch (15) / 6.7‑inch (15 Plus) OLED display, aerospace‑grade aluminum frame, Ceramic‑Shield front, IP68 water‑resistance | 6.1‑inch / 6.7‑inch LTPO OLED, surgical‑grade titanium frame, Ceramic‑Shield front, IP68 |
| **Processor** | A17 Bionic (12‑core CPU, 5‑core GPU) | A18 Bionic (12‑core CPU, 6‑core GPU) |
| **RAM** | 6 GB | 8 GB |
| **Storage** | 128 GB / 256 GB / 512 GB | 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB |
| **Display** | 120 Hz refresh, HDR10, 600 nits max brightness | 120 Hz LTPO (variable refresh 10–120 Hz), HDR10, 1000 nits peak |
| **Camera** | Dual‑camera: 12 MP wide + 12 MP ultra‑wide, Night mode, Deep Fusion, 4K 60 fps video | Triple‑camera: 48 MP wide (f/1.7), 12 MP ultra‑wide, 12 MP telephoto (f/2.8, 3‑x optical zoom), LiDAR, ProRAW, 4K 120 fps video, 8K 30 fps |
| **Front Camera** | 12 MP TrueDepth, 4K 60 fps | 12 MP TrueDepth, 4K 60 fps, ProRes |
| **Battery & Charging** | Up to 20 h talk time, 18 W wired fast‑charge, 15 W MagSafe, 15 W Qi wireless | Up to 22 h talk time, 30 W wired fast‑charge, 20 W MagSafe, 20 W Qi wireless |
| **Connectivity** | 5G (sub‑6 GHz & mmWave), Wi‑Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, U‑WB | Same as above, plus Wi‑Fi 7 (beta) |
| **Other** | USB‑C port, Face ID, new “Dynamic Island” (Pro models), iOS 18, improved thermal management, new color options (e.g., “Aurora Blue”) | Same as above, plus ProMotion display, ProMotion Touch, new “ProMotion” haptic feedback, more storage options |
**Key Highlights**
- **A18 Bionic** delivers ~30 % faster CPU and GPU performance compared to A17.  
- **Pro models** feature a 48‑MP main sensor with pixel‑shift and 4‑K/8‑K video capture.  
- **LTPO OLED** allows adaptive refresh rates for energy savings.  
- **USB‑C** replaces Lightning, enabling faster data transfer and universal charging.  
- **MagSafe 2.0** supports up to 20 W wireless charging and new accessories.  
- **iOS 18** introduces new privacy controls, widgets, and enhanced AR capabilities.  
These are the core specifications and standout features for the iPhone 15 lineup.
